  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.11 Limiting Number of Witnesses or Time",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.11 Limiting Number of Witnesses or Time. The commission shall limit the number of witnesses or the time for testimony or oral argument upon a particular issue, as needed, to avoid unnecessary or cumulative presentation.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 203.21)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
